&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;For New York based hires: Estimated annual salary o $163,000 - $224,000&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
