&lt;p&gt;Compensation may be adjusted depending on work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Estimated annual salary of $102,000-$141,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
