&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote role but the location requirement is that you reside in the Dallas Forth Worth Area.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience coupled with proficiency in Cloud Networking and Security Technology with industry awareness.&lt;/li&gt;
