&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For California (excluding Bay Area), Washington, Washington DC, NY and NJ based hires: Estimated annual On Target Earnings of $324,000 - $446,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For Colorado based hires: Estimated annual base salary of $147,000 - $202,500
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Variable compensation: $147,000 - $202,500&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is also eligible to earn variable compensation in accordance with Cloudflare&#39;s Sales Compensation Plan.&lt;/p&gt;
